    alpha : rotation of the bending plane about +Y. alpha = 0 bends toward +Z (right-hand rule about +Y)
    lambda: unsupported length, port -> start of the neck, along +Y
    beta  : roll of the probe about +Y (turns the camera image; the neck bends in the alpha plane)
